      "incumbent": false,
      "summary": "Jonathan Paz is a former Waltham city councilor who announced a primary challenge to incumbent Katherine Clark in 2026. Born in Boston and having spent eight years growing up in Bolivia, Paz served four years on the Waltham City Council before an unsuccessful mayoral run in 2023. He founded the Fuerza Community Defense Network to monitor ICE activity and advocates for abolishing ICE, redirecting funds to housing, healthcare, and education.",
